        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 1630-SQ Square Offset Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis stunning contemporary design square door pull features on site adjustable offset brackets.  Made in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for  high quality innovational door pull designs.\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-10W-OF-bracket-view.jpg?v=1704442278\" width=\"400\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions 10W-OF Pull Bracket View\">\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\nNote: The Center to Center mounting distance is totally adjustable. Set your desired mounting distance right at the job site. Just slid the offset brackets onto the pull handle and tighten the rear set screws. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nCrafted of solid non rusting aluminum in your choice of 4 high quality powder coated, extra long lasting finish choices.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 1630-SQ Square Offset Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Offset: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Standard Lengths</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-1630-SQ/18: Total Length 18\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-1630-SQ/24: Total Length 24\"</li>\r\n<!-- <li>FII-10W-OF-Teak/36: Total Length 36\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-10W-OF-Teak/48: Total Length 48\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-10W-OF-Teak/60: Total Length 60\"</li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This beautiful  door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts thru the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</b>\r\n</p>",
